        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.19.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bal. 19.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Okhamiina omukholi omutaabi lundi ooli omubanani mu khumuelesia kumuruungo kwewe tawe, akhaba ne ali Omuisiraeli wasio namwe omukwa omenyile mu lukoba lulalakho khu ngoba chenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli endaalo enyanga ne siili khukwa tawe, muruunge khulwe kimilimo kie ndaalo eyo. Sikila ali omutaambi mala chinganakani chewe choosi chili khu rupia echo. Khola orio ne busa akhola ario aalilila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi mala ewe onyoolekhe khuuba omumayaanu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
