                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Okhatiimia bung'ali bwe bakwa ne bafuubi tawe, lundi okhabukula sisibiimbilo sia namulekhwa nga sie khuambiilila kumuruungo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khebulila muli enywe mwaba banasioobi mu Misiri mala Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe amusikula khukhwama ebweeneyo. Khwako mulaka enywe mukhole lino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
