          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ne okesa biakhulia biowo khukhwama mu mukuunda mala wibilile bilala nibio okesile, okhakobolayo wabibukula tawe. Bili bie baakwa, bafuubi, nende banamulekhwa. Khola orio nio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wowo akhuelesie chikhabi mu buli siindu nisio okhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne obuta kamatuunda ke kumuseituni, okhakobolayo wabuta kasikalekho tawe, kali ke baakwa, bafuubi nende banamulekhwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
